<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>What does this mean? <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> is asking for help?<PG>
Could it be she's trying to tease me again?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, that's exactly what made the mood so strange just now, so it would be strange for her to go out of her way to press the attack.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, my guess is that this is what <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> truly feels.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">What's the matter? Are you all right?”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I replied, pretending I didn't know anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had no idea at all what she intended.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe I was fundamentally misunderstanding something.<PG>
But, from the other side of this electronic screen, I could hear an anguished cry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before long, a reply came.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">“At this rate, I'm going to end up killing </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. Help me. Help </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. I don't want to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. Help me.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> kills <STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd suddenly been told something that partly matched my hypothesis.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But...<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, please calm down. It's all right.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, knowing you, you've already figured it out, right? About my dad.”</STYLE><PG>
Really, that man was <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s father...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somehow, all the strength suddenly drained out of me. She had confessed the very thing I'd been trying to ask.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With this, you could say <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> is as good as guilty, but why confess?<PG>
If I contact the police and have them come and protect me, my safety is secured.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So if <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> is the culprit, she has no need to say something like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something doesn't add up.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">I'm sorry. I lied. I looked into </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s father.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I answered honestly, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">“I figured you'd do that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. That's why I wanted to talk to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.”</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">But, why by message?”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">“It's pathetic, but right now I'm crying so hard I can't talk. It doesn't mean anything more than that.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">“It's all right, so please take a deep breath. I'm on your side.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">“Because I,</STYLE><PG>
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
